    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You can post your suggestions or bugs in the discussion forum\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crucial fragment of the Heart of the Earth has been stolen. As a mechanized being re-engineered by its power, you are dispatched to the Moon Tower. Your mission: defeat all enemies, survive the perilous journey, and reclaim the lost fragment of the Heart of the Earth.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >points for attention:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This store page uses machine translation for in-game text.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Feature</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatic Firing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Skills to Eliminate Enemies ( 50 +)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Passive Abilities and Various Attack Methods ( 200 +)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-Paced Action</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose different traits to challenge each game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>",
